Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.92,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,работали,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Над серией работали:\N Лилия, Тирамису, Ананас, Зингер, Бирюлька, Февраль,\NХозяин, Таракан
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,602)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,666)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How much did she hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,First thing she says
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,under the threat of death, will decide her fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She will say that she didn’t hear anything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,or asks for her life, I will kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This will mean that she heard everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.59,0:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill me, you'll get yourself problems for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.49,0:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is still a small thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.37,0:01:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Move that thing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,3 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, today you hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, isn’t it beautiful? Everything is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she stalling for time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Aren't you a thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-I...\N-Now she will say that she is the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,served in special forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think all the cooks in the army are stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Army Chef
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,will kill a ghost with a kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward! I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:03:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How can she say such strange things so confidently?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The face is his weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty hides his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,which means he doesn’t want to reveal himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kim Byungin from the Kim Jwageun family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been robbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't go far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Search everything around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The thief was not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, split up and search everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he staring so ardently at his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Soyeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have experienced a strong shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What scoundrel dared to do this to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden... My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, what the.\N-Why did you break in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We are looking for a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you holding out your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They scared me, so I said my move out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you continue, knowing what I have in my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your problem, why should I lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What a scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just spit in my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Arrest him.\N-Arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What stood up like pillars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let Councilor Hong escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,close the door and get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t know how to fight, but makes a mess of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I’ll cut his temper short!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Protect me.\N-Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Next?\N-Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Advisor Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I will cut your temper short!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It came out convincingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t I even make fun of you anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, will you raise your sword against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But not there! I never got around to getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Missed. Even the sword is not on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think Kim Byungin would be with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it was a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't use the queen as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.01,0:09:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the queen’s reaction
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,was unusual.\NIt haunts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we start acting without understanding it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,let's only make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's first understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But what,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if the queen heard everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust my judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,a bloodbath will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,3 episode: In bed with the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.47,0:10:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him in the coffin,\Nunless it’s the king...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Put away your weapon, put it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like our visit to remain a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She fainted from fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare her bed and nurse her in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you are looking for me when I run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.65,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is your wedding.\NWhy are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that in a little while I would go crazy.\NThat’s why I left the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go for me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will return you to the palace - no one will notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is the dream of my childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I dreamed of becoming a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow my dream will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is my dream
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s scary to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Highness.\N-Don’t call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At least today call me by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So that I don’t forget who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.59,0:13:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,didn’t lose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time I lived thinking that this is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing real about me, everything is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman I knew for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,secretly loved and treasured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let you lose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,happened that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:15.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I called the healer. Wait, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This charlatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I already have a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:23.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let it not be shown here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:26.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Otherwise you will be left without a reproductive organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then maybe you should eat? Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:42.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I feel sick. Looks like he's about to throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And how much did you drink yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:47.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This woman does not tolerate alcohol well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I haven’t disconnected like this for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:55.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How did I get back yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your cousin, Mr. Benin, brought you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You could get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:04.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, only me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:06.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I know that you went out yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.01,0:17:08.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:10.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where did we meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t know exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:17.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, he said that you fainted from fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:19.66,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,-What scared you?\N-I didn’t pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I drank until I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:24.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, it’s cool to be a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The gates were opened during curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:28.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He is your cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:30.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and the adopted son of Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:31.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:38.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where is the court lady Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Late?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:42.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your brother sent her away from the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:45.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,so that no one knows that you are sick with a hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She didn’t want to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:50.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,it was difficult to force her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:54.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why is everyone so reluctant to leave the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:57.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:01.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everything you need is in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:04.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everyone here is hypnotized, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:06.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is something that cannot be found in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:08.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-What is this?\N-Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Outside the palace everything is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:17.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm glad she's not there. She nags me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:19.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:24.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need some spicy ramen for my hangover
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:26.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and sweat. Great medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:29.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is no ramen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:32.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And hangover drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:37.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But here I have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:41.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:43.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Light the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Light the fire.\N-Light the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:48.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have no idea what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:52.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Meal for the Daejojon hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:59.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What nonsense is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:14.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is the meat cooked?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:38.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Well, okay. This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:52.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn. Is this all he can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:58.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What's wrong with my food? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ugh, healthy eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:31.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not spicy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:40.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Very spicy. Did you want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:49.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If you don’t like it, let him come here and cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:53.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,One disorder. I'll cook it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:01.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The furnace has the power of fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:03.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but the fire is difficult to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:06.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The thermal conductivity of the boiler is quite high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:11.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What if you get hurt, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:13.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You haven’t been in the kitchen since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:14.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,how we stopped playing house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.83,0:21:17.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Even if I only came here to play house,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I cook better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Be careful, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:27.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you holding him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Be careful with your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:45.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’m cooking for the first time, so I don’t know if it’s correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:48.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seems like you need to cut it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.49,0:22:52.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:08.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm sure it just looks beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:10.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I bet it's not really seasoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:12.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:15.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes. You are absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:16.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:21.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have worked in the royal kitchen for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:23.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Cooking is the height of skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.89,0:23:26.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:29.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll try it myself to understand how terrible it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.43,0:23:31.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is not tasty at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.14,0:23:46.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.55,0:23:57.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is everything that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Shiitake scent
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.73,0:24:03.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and green onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.66,0:24:07.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Rich aroma of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:12.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The taste of the three ingredients is mixed. And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:28.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"Sam" is three, "hyang" is aroma,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.75,0:24:31.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and “ra” is a pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:33.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Three scents in a pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:35.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"samhyanra".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.23,0:24:43.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Samhyang ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:13.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Exactly as needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.27,0:25:16.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mosodium glutamate there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:17.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.07,0:25:22.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I tried a lot of delicacies,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.88,0:25:25.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but nothing that amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.98,0:25:27.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.85,0:25:33.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Know that if you are offered ramen, this is true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:36.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then if you don’t mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:45.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.40,0:25:48.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You, who have never held a knife before,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:50.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,cook better than a royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.47,0:25:53.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is there something you can’t do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.04,0:25:59.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I was an ideal person, capable of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.85,0:26:02.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But now I can’t do the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:06.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What I was a pro at and loved most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.19,0:26:11.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I see. Embroidery?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.82,0:26:14.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Exactly. You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.03,0:26:17.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:19.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When I touched,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.77,0:26:23.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,flowers were blooming and butterflies were fluttering.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:26.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,That was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.07,0:26:31.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,His Majesty is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.55,0:26:34.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.51,0:26:37.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn. The noodles will soften.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.72,0:26:41.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:46.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:58.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In the morning I visited the elders
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:01.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and I was wondering how you were feeling, so I paid a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.84,0:27:05.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Does he know about last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.44,0:27:07.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is no reason to feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.88,0:27:10.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How was your night?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.45,0:27:12.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.05,0:27:14.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She changes the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.95,0:27:16.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thy prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.49,0:27:22.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Queen, have you been drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.73,0:27:26.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Me? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.50,0:27:28.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Haven’t you been drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.37,0:27:35.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are we playing a staring contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.68,0:27:42.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you were such a good liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:52.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:54.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I usually don’t do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:56.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but you came too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.97,0:28:02.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My nose almost fell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.77,0:28:04.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have a lot to do. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:06.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:10.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will go to the Songjeongjong hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.08,0:28:11.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:19.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It doesn’t look like he’s very busy. \NBut if so, why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.72,0:28:23.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn, now she's softened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.27,0:28:35.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Greetings, king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.47,0:28:36.94,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:39.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Come closer
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.51,0:28:41.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and tell me, do I stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:43.38,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Stinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.81,0:28:45.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can’t say yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.21,0:28:48.41,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Prepare everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:54.02,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,What the hell did my queen eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.19,0:28:57.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What a shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.23,0:29:08.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Kim Byungin has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.97,0:29:11.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Huh, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:16.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I owe you so much for last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.24,0:29:18.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.45,0:29:25.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Since I have a guest, I should offer tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.28,0:29:27.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.65,0:29:29.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Here it fell on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:32.16,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Okay. We have to play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:34.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I missed you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.93,0:29:37.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Glad to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.10,0:29:42.20,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Your words dispelled my worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.30,0:29:44.74,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What touched him so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:46.57,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.34,0:29:50.01,Default,XO,0,0,0,,that you fell into the lake after meeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.01,0:29:52.28,Default,XO,0,0,0,,That day they said they were scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.51,0:29:54.11,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What is it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.48,0:29:59.15,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I said that day that I was scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.15,0:30:02.39,Default,XO,0,0,0,,And I was afraid?..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.12,0:30:08.09,Default,XO,0,0,0,,There is nothing worse in the world than people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.46,0:30:10.76,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Are you being threatened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.46,0:30:13.73,Default,XO,0,0,0,,You know who pushed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.73,0:30:15.27,Default,XO,0,0,0,,you into the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.27,0:30:16.90,Default,XO,0,0,0,,and attacked last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.60,0:30:19.10,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.20,0:30:21.14,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I know about the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:23.54,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What about last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:27.01,Default,ХО,0,0,0,,-What are you talking about?\N-You don’t remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.38,0:30:29.62,Default,XO,0,0,0,,They tried to kill you last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:31.12,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:33.12,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Did I almost die?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.12,0:30:34.95,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Who was it? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.95,0:30:36.96,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I hoped you knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.86,0:30:39.49,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but I see no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.06,0:30:43.93,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What? Have two people already tried to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.43,0:30:46.06,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Is this woman in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.06,0:30:47.77,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The day you fell into the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.77,0:30:51.27,Default,XO,0,0,0,,you said you were scared. I think it has something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.54,0:30:55.01,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It seems you are not aware yet.\N I have problems with my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.01,0:30:58.54,Default,XO,0,0,0,,You better know what we were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.75,0:31:01.25,Default,XO,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.92,0:31:06.55,Default,XO,0,0,0,,forgot everything about that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.55,0:31:09.32,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Yes, I don’t remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:13.76,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.76,0:31:15.96,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Tell me, this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.56,0:31:20.50,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What did this bastard do to me yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:23.24,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It was getting close to curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.24,0:31:24.97,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Judging by the way he wielded the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.97,0:31:28.17,Default,XO,0,0,0,,and he was dressed, he is not an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.44,0:31:30.58,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I don’t know how many there were,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.64,0:31:33.04,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but they helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.05,0:31:35.61,Default,XO,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for you, I would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.61,0:31:38.42,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we met yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.39,0:31:45.86,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:53.27,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.24,0:32:00.84,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Why did you leave the palace last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.84,0:32:03.88,Default,ХО,0,0,0,,I got bored and decided to take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.64,0:32:09.58,Default,XO,0,0,0,,If the Queen Dowager finds out,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.58,0:32:12.12,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I’m in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:15.69,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Not only will my freedom of movement be curtailed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.69,0:32:17.66,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but Hongyeon is also executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.26,0:32:21.23,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Can you keep this a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.59,0:32:23.93,Default,XO,0,0,0,,But we need to find the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.36,0:32:26.26,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Do it quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.33,0:32:29.20,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'm going to get in trouble, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.20,0:32:31.70,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.70,0:32:34.07,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Who knew that you left the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.07,0:32:36.27,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Honyoung only.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:40.31,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'll have people watch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.31,0:32:44.55,Default,XO,0,0,0,,No, she is faithful to me, she is even ready to die for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.55,0:32:45.98,Default,XO,0,0,0,,She has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.98,0:32:49.96,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, don’t trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.96,0:32:51.89,Default,ХО,0,0,0,,I’ve known her for a long time, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.89,0:32:54.53,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but those closest to you are always more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.26,0:32:58.70,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Just because you are in the palace does not mean that nothing threatens you. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.53,0:33:02.80,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It’s even more dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.20,0:33:07.11,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Exactly, I completely forgot where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.11,0:33:09.21,Default,XO,0,0,0,,In a palace full of intrigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.21,0:33:12.78,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The place where your life is always in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.48,0:33:16.78,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:19.38,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.95,0:33:21.72,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Thanks, but
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.95,0:33:23.72,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I can handle it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:27.29,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.59,0:33:31.06,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Don’t try to appear strong in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.61,0:33:49.75,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Maybe you forgot,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.18,0:33:52.32,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but I will remember forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.75,0:33:55.95,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The memory of that night will forever remain in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.23,0:34:04.33,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I will find out who it was at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.30,0:34:09.07,Default,XO,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.20,0:34:14.44,Default,XO,0,0,0,,They sell silk yarn here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.94,0:34:16.41,Default,XO,0,0,0,,from Qing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.19,0:34:39.50,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I heard that you have valuable goods from the Qing, so I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.24,0:34:49.01,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Rumors fly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.84,0:34:52.28,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.56,0:35:13.53,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Do you store valuables in such a creepy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.47,0:35:16.97,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Because they are valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.25,0:35:31.68,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.85,0:35:33.55,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.85,0:35:37.82,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Close one eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.29,0:35:42.23,Default,XO,0,0,0,,And then turn. That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.23,0:35:44.56,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Master! Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.56,0:35:46.06,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.83,0:35:48.90,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It seems you misunderstood me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.90,0:35:51.54,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'm looking for silk yarn...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.57,0:35:55.74,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I wanted to buy yarn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.61,0:35:59.38,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What should I do with this pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.23,0:36:20.00,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Kim Byungin said not to trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:21.67,Default,XO,0,0,0,,So how can you trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.23,0:36:24.37,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Honyeon wouldn't harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.64,0:36:27.11,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Maybe Cho Hwajin again?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.14,0:36:29.47,Default,XO,0,0,0,,A week is an eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.47,0:36:31.58,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It won’t take long to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.28,0:36:33.88,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I’ll do what I’m good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.88,0:36:35.58,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I will win with food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:37.52,Default,XO,0,0,0,,She will defeat any armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.62,Default,XO,0,0,0,,And it will work on the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.65,0:36:44.09,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.26,0:36:46.69,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Are these the Queen Dowager's leftovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.69,0:36:48.19,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.30,0:36:52.60,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.80,0:36:54.57,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Leftovers can give an idea
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.57,0:36:56.94,Default,XO,0,0,0,,about health and preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.94,0:36:59.60,Default,XO,0,0,0,,You can't look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:01.04,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Remove.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:03.98,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What are you doing? I'm the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.98,0:37:05.48,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.48,0:37:07.78,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but I am the royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:09.68,Default,XO,0,0,0,,This means that in the kitchen -
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:11.98,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I am the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.88,0:37:15.65,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Then let our skills speak for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.79,0:37:18.46,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Let's see who's king here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.19,0:37:23.03,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Don’t say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.16,0:37:26.46,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It’s time for me to cook. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.83,0:37:29.37,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What, you were afraid to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:32.97,Default,XO,0,0,0,,A person who only played in the kitchen as a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.85,0:37:50.05,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Well, how are the preparations?..
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:20.92,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.79,0:38:25.52,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.52,0:38:28.39,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.39,0:38:30.63,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.63,0:38:46.81,Default,XO,0,0,0,,-Queen!\N-Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.52,0:38:59.22,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.23,0:39:05.76,Default,XO,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:09.30,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.54,0:39:14.04,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.64,0:39:16.47,Default,XO,0,0,0,,speed is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.47,0:39:19.34,Default,XO,0,0,0,,But taste is even more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:20.85,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.62,0:39:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-You.\N-What did you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.95,0:39:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by your clothes, you don’t work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.36,0:39:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.42,0:39:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I am checking the royal offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.83,0:39:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Inspector of the Royal Kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.33,0:39:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then check the food for taste.\N-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.47,0:39:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone present here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.93,0:39:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,will not be able to honestly evaluate the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be brave, try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.64,0:39:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.19,0:40:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not tried anything like this until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.33,0:40:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like bliss,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.66,0:40:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,this dish makes my mouth happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.67,0:40:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In my entire life, my tongue has never tasted anything more beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.50,0:40:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.21,0:40:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.59,0:40:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare a girl enter the royal kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.99,0:40:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.60,0:40:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this meant for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.97,0:40:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare a girl enter the royal kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.21,0:41:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.19,0:41:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.49,0:41:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.59,0:41:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the first,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.46,0:41:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and my food tastes great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm in the kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.33,0:41:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,my word is law.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.91,0:41:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, Your Majesty.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.44,0:41:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not enough for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.41,0:41:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want, I can take you on as a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.62,0:41:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, His Majesty is now in the Daejojong Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.57,0:41:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe such an early visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.04,0:41:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.90,0:42:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And you’re really cute today.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.87,0:42:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn’t it time for you to return to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.48,0:42:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Special Forces.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something you want to tell me about this word?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.22,0:42:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this some kind of game?\N-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.59,0:42:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.59,0:42:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Army cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.49,0:42:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.23,0:42:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,God. Well, really, you are the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.36,0:42:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I’ll say something, and you’ll execute me for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.57,0:42:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.00,0:42:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What nonsense are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.08,0:42:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You use foul language for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.41,0:42:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be unhappy with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.21,0:42:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything that bothers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.58,0:42:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want, I can even stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.49,0:42:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, everything is fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.32,0:42:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I really can’t get enough of how wonderful my life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.29,0:42:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone today?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.00,0:43:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.27,0:43:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How much did she hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.23,0:43:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just want to know how your day was.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.24,0:43:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave after we talk a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.78,0:43:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my cousin came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.48,0:43:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.78,0:43:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin, if I'm not mistaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.35,0:43:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he need?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.62,0:43:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like I’m being interrogated?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.69,0:43:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too impressionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried about my relatives
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.19,0:43:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.83,0:43:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.13,0:43:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just came to say hello and congratulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.17,0:43:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, then I don’t have to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask, why are you treating me this way these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.14,0:43:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She hates me because she knows I'm a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.15,0:43:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.05,0:43:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you love madly,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.78,0:43:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,after the wedding, romance goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.32,0:43:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Satisfied? You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.92,0:44:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. Bring bed linen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.89,0:44:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? We didn't agree that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.70,0:44:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Conversations have tired me,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.30,0:44:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,no strength to return to Hijeongjon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.97,0:44:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory by day, setup by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.11,0:44:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s kind of suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.82,0:44:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow she’s suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.59,0:44:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.16,0:44:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you should not trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.83,0:44:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he definitely has no faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.23,0:44:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where or when,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.00,0:44:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and the husband is the first to be suspected of murdering his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.68,0:44:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he’ll tell you something in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.88,0:44:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he’s up to something and is waiting for me to fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.45,0:45:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-I can’t fall asleep.\N-I can’t fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.08,0:46:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.32,0:46:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.26,0:46:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.46,0:46:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.29,0:46:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,God. He might die like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.23,0:46:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Wake up! Wake up, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.74,0:46:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.88,0:46:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.38,0:46:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.02,0:46:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.09,0:46:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.69,0:46:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.49,0:46:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-My queen.\N-Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.36,0:46:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that I will die if you hit me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.93,0:46:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have died if I hadn’t woken you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggled like a worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.30,0:47:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit me because I said the name of another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.04,0:47:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.61,0:47:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care who you call.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.85,0:47:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep our distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.05,0:47:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.95,0:47:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're up,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.22,0:47:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you better go back to your place
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.20,0:47:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If I leave now, I'll have to wake up my servants. \NThis is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.77,0:47:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How generous we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.24,0:47:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my queen, thank you for the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.55,0:47:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,God, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.55,0:47:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.09,0:47:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are a real strongwoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.56,0:47:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lie down and go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.70,0:48:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A merciful king must be able to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.59,0:48:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I sleep in Daejeon, my whole body hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.73,0:48:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So we shouldn't sleep together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.33,0:48:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be because I'm not used to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.63,0:48:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to stay more often until I get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.57,0:48:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to wake up again because of your nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.31,0:48:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t remember any nightmares,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.11,0:48:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is how they hit me for saying the name of another,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.31,0:48:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.31,0:48:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I’ll say your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.08,0:48:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.39,0:49:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I even lost my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.03,0:49:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have already eaten, then you can go. I have things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.40,0:49:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so busy with?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.30,0:49:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Work.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.80,0:49:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I can’t use my phone and social networks,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.40,0:49:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,then I have no choice but to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.11,0:49:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Social networks?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.98,0:49:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Social networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.31,0:49:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. Love should be tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.88,0:49:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight I will be tenderness itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.97,0:49:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.64,0:49:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.21,0:49:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.61,0:49:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You confuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.95,0:49:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I show what I’m capable of?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:49:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.06,0:50:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.23,0:50:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything started spinning and spinning,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.90,0:50:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,in general, I spent several nights with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.40,0:50:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But we didn’t sleep with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.24,0:50:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We were only pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.21,0:50:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, he usually goes to his chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.78,0:50:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But yesterday it seemed to have been replaced:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.61,0:50:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he refused to go to his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.65,0:50:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.48,0:50:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing at night, and there will be nothing in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked to meet to tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.79,0:50:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.29,0:50:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true she pushed me into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.00,0:50:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And then too?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.16,0:50:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it’s worth slowing down for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.47,0:50:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so hard when a beautiful girl hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.31,0:50:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you didn’t hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.48,0:51:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that the wind was not in your favor this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.41,0:51:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you trust me and wait a couple of days...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.42,0:51:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I definitely shouldn’t trust in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.79,0:51:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To you, Your Majesty. Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.76,0:51:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe anything you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.03,0:51:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And don’t try to come between His Majesty and me yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.23,0:51:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,better give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.87,0:51:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I started living from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.71,0:51:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see how I've changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.21,0:51:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You have changed for the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.01,0:51:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You smile in my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.55,0:51:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but behind my back blame me for what happened on the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.68,0:51:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I never blamed you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.55,0:51:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t know who it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.82,0:51:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you are suspected because you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.12,0:51:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.93,0:51:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who did this is
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.57,0:51:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.11,0:52:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell into the water on purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.98,0:52:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,to set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.79,0:52:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by how angry she is, she's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.63,0:52:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know why she looks at me so coldly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.16,0:52:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The incident in the lake was fabricated. What remains is the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.10,0:52:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that someone is following me does not change.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.37,0:52:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you need to return to the Daejojeon Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.74,0:52:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Court Lady Choi, \Ngo first to Daejojong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.02,0:52:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happens, think of something
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.22,0:52:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and send Hongyeon after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.92,0:52:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t dare...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.99,0:52:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way you can help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.29,0:52:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.09,0:52:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.10,0:53:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.27,0:53:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How often do you serve the Dowager Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.77,0:53:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t say for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but several times a day for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.58,0:53:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean to say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.15,0:53:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but in Joseon there are many who can \Nbecome a royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.62,0:53:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have breakfast, lunch, afternoon snack,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.13,0:53:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,light snacks, dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and night snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.26,0:53:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And she eats it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.46,0:53:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once every 3-4 days
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.60,0:53:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,she refuses lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.04,0:53:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,On such a day she asks for honey and ginger powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.15,0:53:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn’t eat
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.71,0:53:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,cold and something to chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.62,0:53:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn’t ask to change the menu,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.59,0:53:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,which means he wants to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.46,0:54:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I look more at their faces than their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.66,0:54:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t they all handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.76,0:54:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bam.\N-Bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.33,0:54:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.93,0:54:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the sound of a shot is so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.10,0:54:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to be louder. "Bam"!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.27,0:54:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bam.\N-Bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.37,0:54:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dear Minister of War, your headdress is askew.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.91,0:54:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you allowing yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.58,0:54:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard you asked the king to transfer you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.15,0:54:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to the Office of the Royal Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.75,0:54:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The management of the royal guard is not troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.92,0:54:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you can mess around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.66,0:54:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Such rumors are circulating,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.16,0:54:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and I thought: this is what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.36,0:54:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t like to strain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.64,0:54:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-When?\N-This night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.91,0:54:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.09,0:55:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fly agaric powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.66,0:55:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Odorless and tasteless.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.59,0:55:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mix with alcohol and reveal all the secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.50,0:55:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the queen knew something,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.70,0:55:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,she wouldn’t sit silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.60,0:55:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s either up to something,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.94,0:55:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,or waiting for the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.47,0:55:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.42,0:55:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong doesn't have enough ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.22,0:55:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He sticks to His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.92,0:55:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and hangs around with Hong Byulgam
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.30,0:55:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hon Byulgam
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.00,0:55:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,still the same slacker,\N shirking his responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.81,0:55:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal Guard Office is just a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.08,0:55:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s better to let him sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.78,0:56:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost not only his father and brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.55,0:56:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but also his mother and grandparents right before his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.78,0:56:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This served him as a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.15,0:56:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, when will you be appointed head of the royal guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.89,0:56:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.29,0:56:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to get everything sorted out before it's assigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.57,0:56:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you profited from the exchange of military information again?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t cross the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.11,0:56:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I already told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.14,0:56:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that an unstable army is very dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.74,0:56:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.88,0:56:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.15,0:56:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.35,0:56:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel something dangerous is happening outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.56,0:56:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.92,0:56:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,On the way to Oktajeong a couple of days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.46,0:56:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Okthajeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.73,0:56:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I made friends with one guy
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.00,0:56:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,with the wonderful name Lee Sanman.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.30,0:57:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lee Senman.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.17,0:57:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.51,0:57:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No. But the name seems familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.81,0:57:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He is probably from a famous noble family.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.21,0:57:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have never heard his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.92,0:57:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, when we went to Okthajeong with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.55,0:57:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,unexpectedly someone hit me,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.52,0:57:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and I lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.33,0:57:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When I woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.93,0:57:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,realized that Lee Senman had disappeared like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.47,0:57:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how he was dressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.94,0:57:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Of course.\N-On it
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.04,0:57:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,were there clothes made of such fabric?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.02,0:57:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.09,0:57:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.59,0:57:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see your friend again,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.46,0:57:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,find out what happened then.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.23,0:57:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.90,0:58:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you giving me a special task?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.23,0:58:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call this a special task.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.94,0:58:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.74,0:58:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You come to the palace every day, but do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.18,0:58:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean I’m not doing anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.28,0:58:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And a whole day is not enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.21,0:58:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,just to greet everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.55,0:58:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This task is ideal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.52,0:58:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This special task.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.86,0:58:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.51,0:58:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(Social distancing)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.89,0:58:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,(Social distancing)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.66,0:59:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.09,0:59:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.29,0:59:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.23,0:59:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.94,0:59:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.94,0:59:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.21,0:59:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Social distancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the queen, this means “We will live happily.”
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.28,0:59:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But where do the words come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.69,0:59:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.93,0:59:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe from Buddhist scriptures?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.34,0:59:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have tea with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.61,0:59:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.42,1:00:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep thinking about what the queen said,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.66,1:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,because some of her wonderful words\N may have some meaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.36,1:00:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.70,1:00:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.94,1:00:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.57,1:00:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this happen today?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.27,1:00:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The faster the better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.51,1:00:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.08,1:00:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me more clay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.85,1:00:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.32,1:00:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your order,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.56,1:00:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you damage the oven...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.39,1:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me not spoil it. This is an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.83,1:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a crazy woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.37,1:00:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you crazy person, what are these little stones!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.01,1:01:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hard?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.91,1:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help. This one is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.28,1:01:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Too big.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.38,1:01:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you put this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.02,1:01:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Oil, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.45,1:01:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. As you ordered, I brought all the varieties - rapeseed, sesame, peril
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.52,1:01:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and generally everything I found.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.49,1:01:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.43,1:01:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a gem!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.23,1:01:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. This is our annual supply of oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.57,1:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooking is 80% ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.64,1:01:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My fate depends on this food.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.64,1:01:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.71,1:01:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty has long since gone to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.81,1:01:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, I have a child debt here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.78,1:01:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. I poured everything out, everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.20,1:02:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you bring all our precious gifts to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.17,1:02:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I would already be lying in the earth if I hadn’t brought it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.44,1:02:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We threaten, they will drag us even more.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.71,1:02:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you shaking?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.95,1:02:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t even weigh. What is she going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.26,1:02:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Such valuable ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.47,1:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, done. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.84,1:02:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.21,1:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Take this. \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.01,1:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Put it in there.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.18,1:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-I say, stick it there.\N -Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.49,1:02:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.96,1:03:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Highest quality croaker - \Nand just threw it into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.33,1:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of quirks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.35,1:03:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I apologize if I overstep the boundaries,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.29,1:03:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but Her Majesty is in the royal kitchen
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.96,1:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,monitors the preparation of food for the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.83,1:03:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.40,1:03:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.65,1:03:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.02,1:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.22,1:04:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I passed out for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.70,1:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My destiny depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.78,1:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It will burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.23,1:05:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.50,1:05:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I don’t need breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.64,1:05:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen prepared it herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.48,1:05:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Has the Queen prepared?\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.32,1:05:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent the whole night on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.32,1:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the effort,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.56,1:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but what is it even made of?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.43,1:05:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks different.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.80,1:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She cooked from beef, pork
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.90,1:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and croaker - all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.74,1:05:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,More like embroidery than food.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.21,1:06:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have no appetite,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.48,1:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but you say she spent the whole night.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.85,1:06:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful, so I'll try a piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.18,1:06:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no news?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.75,1:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.12,1:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This won’t work. I'll go myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.19,1:06:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.24,1:07:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Victory?\N-How could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.48,1:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiasco?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.52,1:07:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hide such a talent?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.89,1:07:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.49,1:07:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know how long it’s been since I’ve enjoyed food this much.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.16,1:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited about the food,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.40,1:07:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that I was really angry!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.67,1:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Triumph.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.17,1:07:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.44,1:07:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.81,1:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like I could eat this every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.05,1:07:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you prepare this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.98,1:07:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never tried such a delicate texture before,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.95,1:07:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,what a rich taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.82,1:07:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I cooked in oil on very low heat all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.43,1:08:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I put the fish in oil on the coals in the oven,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.73,1:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to cook slowly all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.30,1:08:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted the crust to be crispy and the meat tender.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.37,1:08:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,To make the meat chew better,\N I put it in a cauldron with oil
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.61,1:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and cooked on low heat overnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.88,1:08:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This method preserves both the nutrients of the food and its smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.45,1:08:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It is also good for health and\Nhelps against aging.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.85,1:08:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Very healthy food.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.29,1:08:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called confit -\N a French cooking technique.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.99,1:08:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only tasty, but also healthy?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.56,1:08:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn this method?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.70,1:08:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is an insight?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.67,1:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I was thinking about how to please Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.94,1:08:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so many days already.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.38,1:08:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fatal blow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.38,1:08:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.95,1:08:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the end of days
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.75,1:08:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be young
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.69,1:08:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.03,1:09:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I allow the lake to be filled with water.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.59,1:09:33.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You will fill it like this until the collapse of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.26,1:09:36.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We need ten days, no less.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.53,1:09:38.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What? So that in a minute there will be water
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.73,1:09:41.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,or I'll blow your heads off!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.03,1:09:44.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.24,1:09:52.44,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Now we need two more days.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.18,1:09:54.81,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Stop, don’t move!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.75,1:10:00.35,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I came up with something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.45,1:10:03.59,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Life-giving water is flowing!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.29,1:10:06.19,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Hold it.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.19,1:10:08.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Life-giving water is flowing!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.39,1:10:12.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Who knew that things would go faster this way?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.43,1:10:14.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Well done! Just like that!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.33,1:10:17.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Pick it up quickly.\N-Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.21,1:10:30.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m not a queen, but a genius of local thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.08,1:10:31.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Well done. Great fellows.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.75,1:10:35.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Until you fill the lake, forget about sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.05,1:10:36.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Obey!\N-Obey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.17,1:10:56.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Honyeon, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.51,1:11:00.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If she's faking it,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.68,1:11:05.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,then it certainly won’t be able to fool me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.73,1:11:22.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The fabric is really rare,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.10,1:11:26.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can’t tell you where it was woven.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.41,1:11:33.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But I can
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.18,1:11:36.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,try to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.58,1:11:41.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You can’t give up without trying, don’t you agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.75,1:11:43.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I like your approach.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.66,1:11:51.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I was worried that the king didn't care about the queen,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.56,1:11:54.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but it seems that all my worries have come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.30,1:11:58.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What else can you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.70,1:12:01.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Last night, while the queen
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.87,1:12:04.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,was in the palace kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.24,1:12:06.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the king was waiting for her alone
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.61,1:12:09.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,in the Daejojeon Hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.05,1:12:14.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I advised the king to go to Hwijojong Hall,\Nbut he said that he would not go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.45,1:12:20.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it, our king is so worried about his wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.56,1:12:23.66,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Got it, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.76,1:12:26.23,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.50,1:12:32.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let them spend nights together more often,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.10,1:12:34.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,so feelings will flare up between them faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.87,1:12:37.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen gave me her royal word.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.21,1:12:39.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Have you given the floor?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.51,1:12:42.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,She promised to conceive a prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.38,1:12:43.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you talking about!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.78,1:12:45.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Then in our family
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.58,1:12:48.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,will a blood heir to the throne be born?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.92,1:12:52.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.26,1:12:54.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Exactly,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.76,1:12:57.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,look.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.33,1:13:01.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Eat it, and your skin will become like a baby's.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.33,1:13:03.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What an expensive gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.60,1:13:06.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you like its action,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.07,1:13:09.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I won’t regret anything, but I’ll find you more.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.31,1:13:11.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.11,1:13:17.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I still can’t believe\Nthat everything turned out so great.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.68,1:13:21.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,When the queen fell into the lake,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.02,1:13:23.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I almost went crazy with excitement!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.09,1:13:25.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Poor, innocent child.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.62,1:13:29.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm so proud that she was able\Nto maintain her high position.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.83,1:13:32.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Tears well up with happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.10,1:13:35.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Tell it like it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.00,1:13:37.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'll be honest, the queen is not an innocent child at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.30,1:13:40.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Our queen...\NHow can I say it more correctly?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.34,1:13:43.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Smart?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.81,1:13:46.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,A little wrong word.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.11,1:13:50.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Scrupulous?\N-Not that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.15,1:13:52.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,There is a perfect word.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.45,1:13:55.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Then...\N-Sophisticated?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.12,1:13:57.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.76,1:14:02.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Unique?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.46,1:14:05.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Exactly! Unique girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.63,1:14:08.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We can’t find a better queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.03,1:14:09.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.77,1:14:14.04,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I look at her and see you in your youth!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.24,1:14:15.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.45,1:14:24.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Have you gone crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.78,1:14:27.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Did you see this with your own eyes?\NWith these?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.72,1:14:30.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,At least someone in the palace personally saw it,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.32,1:14:32.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,for the concubine to push the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.09,1:14:35.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Was it worth it?\NEveryone already knows it’s her!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.49,1:14:37.16,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Exactly!\N-She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.16,1:14:38.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, everyone knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.26,1:14:42.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,As they say, the thief’s cap burns.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.63,1:14:44.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,These rumors didn’t come out of thin air.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.94,1:14:51.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.41,1:14:54.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Get ready! Tomorrow morning there will be a rumor that you are a bald fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.48,1:14:55.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.78,1:14:57.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let me go! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.65,1:14:59.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.75,1:15:01.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen set her up!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.95,1:15:03.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,When my lady passed by,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.62,1:15:05.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the queen jumped into the water on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.89,1:15:08.06,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Before you chat, find out the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.51,1:15:26.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Today I definitely...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:55.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I thought\Nyou would practice your writing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.14,1:15:57.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,When I went to Yejan,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.91,1:16:00.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,to play tudjon with Mr. Hong,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.51,1:16:02.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I saw something that amazed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.78,1:16:10.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Someone from a long distance\Nthrew a dagger at the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.69,1:16:15.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I thought why not try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.56,1:16:18.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is very dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.26,1:16:20.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,what if you get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.47,1:16:31.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How long have we known each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.51,1:16:36.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Two years, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.95,1:16:41.35,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.09,1:16:48.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,During this time you learned everything in the world about me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.86,1:16:50.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,became my arms and legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.63,1:16:53.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,As if we have known each other for many years.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.63,1:16:57.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.07,1:16:59.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your job?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.97,1:17:03.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Maybe this is your job,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.71,1:17:05.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but I can't stop thinking about
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.24,1:17:08.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,are you devoted to me, because you have to
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.61,1:17:10.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,or
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.08,1:17:14.15,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,because you yourself want it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.75,1:17:17.99,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm sure your feelings are sincere.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.99,1:17:22.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Thank you for noticing, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.96,1:17:24.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.36,1:17:28.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If not for you, then for whom?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.04,1:17:37.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I thought it would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.11,1:17:42.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But did you doubt me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.68,1:17:47.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.22,1:17:49.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,With age I have become more cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.62,1:17:54.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Tonight\NI will go to the Daejojeon Hall early.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.49,1:17:56.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'll prepare everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.96,1:18:35.83,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,To meet you,\Nwe had to come early.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.20,1:18:39.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How diligent you are, however.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.27,1:18:41.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,So much effort just so we can sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.17,1:18:43.81,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We have prepared drinks and snacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.94,1:18:46.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why is this even necessary?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.11,1:18:48.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I know you like to drink,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.11,1:18:50.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,so I ordered them to be prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.35,1:18:51.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm done with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.95,1:18:56.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I thought about this too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.42,1:18:59.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We brought treats for tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.37,1:19:14.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is Arabic jasmine tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.27,1:19:17.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you suffer from insomnia or anxiety,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.74,1:19:19.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,it will calm you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.75,1:19:28.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Jasmine Gull?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.82,1:19:31.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What a strong smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.63,1:19:44.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That night the whole room smelled of jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.97,1:19:52.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The smell even soaked into his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.24,1:20:26.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.68,1:20:31.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.85,1:20:34.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t reveal all your cards so recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.79,1:20:43.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Especially in the palace, where everyone has their own secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.24,1:20:56.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.64,1:20:57.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.64,1:20:59.21,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.49,1:21:18.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Have I really fallen into the trap of her deceitful eyes and words?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.96,1:21:20.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Make her tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.73,1:21:22.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Who sent the letter?\N-The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.90,1:21:24.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Only until the lake is filled with water.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.47,1:21:26.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will endure all this, and then I will return home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.87,1:21:28.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The person we are looking for is a court lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.64,1:21:31.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do everything not to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.54,1:21:34.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I found out where this fabric came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.01,1:21:35.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,From the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.28,1:21:37.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your need is a royal spouse, not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.25,1:21:39.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do you want to return everything back?\NThis is revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.85,1:21:42.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-That’s what I did to you.\N-Do you think I can’t?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,


